    "created_at": "2022-07-29T15:50:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-07-29T15:50:51Z",
    "body": "If you indeed meant `FileSystemWritableFileStream` in the original comment, that has a `locked` attribute because it inherits from `WritableStream` (so it indicates if the stream is locked, not if the underlying file is locked).",
