    "updated_at": "2022-08-02T04:01:00Z",
    "body": "Yes, I meant FileSystemWritableFileStream, and I missed that WritableStream has 'locked' (when someone else committed FileSystemWritableFileStream.webidl to our repo, it was missing the inheritance from WritableStream, so the wpt test failed).   I had assumed 'locked' applied to the locking specified in this spec.",
